# .vercelignore
#
# This project's Root Directory setting (Vercel dashboard) is
# "inaya-network-dapp" — .vercelignore has to live HERE, not at the
# monorepo root, for `vercel deploy` (run from the monorepo root, where
# .vercel/project.json is linked) to actually respect it. A duplicate
# also exists at the monorepo root for the same reason, since it wasn't
# obvious which location the CLI reads from without checking — better to
# cover both than have this silently do nothing again.
#
# Without this, a deploy uploads this app's own node_modules (multiple
# GB) even though .gitignore already excludes it — .gitignore and
# .vercelignore are not automatically the same list for a CLI-driven
# deploy the way they are for git-integration-triggered deploys.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
custody-sdk
.env
.env.local
**/.env
**/.env.local
